.TH SKIPPERD 8 "August 2026" "Skipper 360 v0.1.0" "System Administration Commands"
.SH NAME
skipperd \- Skipper 360 PTY session supervisor daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B skipperd
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBskipperd\fR is the background daemon component of Skipper 360.
It manages single-instance PID locking, listens for IPC requests over a Unix Domain Socket (\fB~/.config/skipper360/skipper.sock\fR), allocates PTY sessions, detects password prompts via regex patterns, and performs secure memory-zeroed password injection from the OS Keyring.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/skipper360/config.toml
Main TOML configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.config/skipper360/skipper.sock
Unix Domain Socket (mode 0600) for IPC communication.
.TP
.I ~/.config/skipper360/skipper.pid
PID lockfile preventing multiple daemon instances.
.TP
.I ~/.config/skipper360/skipper.log
Daemon execution and audit logfile.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR skipper (1)
